{"thread":{"threadID":4221,"boardID":166,"topic":"Coinflip Plugin","time":1488130268,"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","lastPostTime":1488256736,"lastPoster":"Burn","replies":30,"views":747,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":8},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":62554,"threadID":4221,"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","subject":"Coinflip Plugin","time":1488130268,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":8,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2338,"username":"[eXo]","time":1488130409,"value":1},{"userID":2365,"username":"MistaHT","time":1488130733,"value":1},{"userID":2318,"username":"PEYZO","time":1488131740,"value":1},{"userID":1981,"username":"Abgehoben","time":1488131779,"value":1},{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1488132361,"value":1},{"userID":2349,"username":"chaotic","time":1488135078,"value":1},{"userID":2229,"username":"WHAT","time":1488137806,"value":1},{"userID":2151,"username":"Saitama","time":1488142014,"value":1},{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1488144849,"value":1},{"userID":2052,"username":"YellowWonderchild","time":1488146424,"value":1},{"userID":1153,"username":"Schockly","time":1488200297,"value":1},{"userID":1173,"username":"Nightlight","time":1488133789,"value":-1},{"userID":2223,"username":"NekoCedx3","time":1488139789,"value":-1},{"userID":2165,"username":"Makaveli1967","time":1488189196,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hallöchen zusammen,<br>Aus Frust hätte ich da einen Vorschlag. Da RPS mich langsam salzig macht, wollte ihr ein Coinflip System vorschlagen, da dort die Chance 50/50 ist und Random. Als ich <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2338-exo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@[eXo]</a> darauf ansprach, hat er mir einen Link dazu geschickt, und mein Vorschlag und gleichzeitig Wunsch ist, diesen umsetzen zu lassen.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Link vom Plugin:<br><a href=\"https://forums.alliedmods.net/showthread.php?p=2495615\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":62557,"threadID":4221,"userID":1173,"username":"Nightlight","subject":"","time":1488131978,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":9,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2106,"username":"ifZ4ne","time":1488132482,"value":1},{"userID":2378,"username":"Verdia","time":1488133650,"value":1},{"userID":2326,"username":"Unicorn24","time":1488138494,"value":1},{"userID":2223,"username":"NekoCedx3","time":1488139779,"value":1},{"userID":2052,"username":"YellowWonderchild","time":1488146435,"value":1},{"userID":2165,"username":"Makaveli1967","time":1488148488,"value":1},{"userID":1447,"username":"iSh00ter","time":1488174830,"value":1},{"userID":2520,"username":"Technodog","time":1488189480,"value":1},{"userID":2528,"username":"Red_Zone","time":1488190166,"value":1},{"userID":2386,"username":"Mr.Pro","time":1488228634,"value":1},{"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","time":1488144921,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich wäre dafür diese ganze Glücksspielscheiße komplett aus den Servern wieder zu entfernen.<br>Sonst geraten die ganzen Kiddys auf die falsche Bahn, ich meine die gambeln ja jetzt schon mit Skins von Papas Kreditkarte da müssen die nicht noch auf Dream mit credits spielen.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>#DreamHatErziehungsAuftrag.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":62561,"threadID":4221,"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","subject":"","time":1488134195,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","time":1488136687,"value":1},{"userID":1173,"username":"Nightlight","time":1488139120,"value":1},{"userID":2165,"username":"Makaveli1967","time":1488148503,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich finde auch, dass diese Glücksspiele teils nach hinten losgegangen sind.<br>Jetzt hört man durchgehend 11 Minuten lange RPS-Session und wie dann irgendwelche Leute jubeln und ihre Credits 10 mal im Chat zeigen.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Wenn wir ehrlich sind, ist das Ganze doch sowieso unnötig. <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":62562,"threadID":4221,"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","subject":"","time":1488134513,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2356,"username":"DerXXLMario","time":1488145748,"value":1},{"userID":2513,"username":"FreeZ","time":1488316501,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Credits sind ein virtueller Schwanzvergleich. Ist einfach Fakt.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":62563,"threadID":4221,"userID":2349,"username":"chaotic","subject":"","time":1488134801,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"Klingt besser (Wortwiederholung) xD","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2237,"username":"Gaara","time":1488136396,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Wäre dafür, derzeit gibt es nur viele Leute mit vielen Credits. Und dann gibt es noch Leute die wenig Credits haben bzw ständig auf 0 sind, bzw sogar deshalb betteln. Doch hab ich selbst noch kein &quot;Mittelfeld&quot; gesehen.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Mit dem RPS kommt der Credits-Fluss wieder bisschen ins &quot;strömen&quot;.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Der Coinflip wäre allerdings nur was für Leute wichtig die eh zuviele Credits haben und sie nicht brauchen und die die nur noch paar brauchen und deshalb wahrscheinlich gamblen. Sind sie doch selbst schuld wenn sie ihre Credits verzocken, ist ja nicht so als wären sie etwas limitiertes.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>MFG chaotic <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":62564,"threadID":4221,"userID":2229,"username":"WHAT","subject":"","time":1488136485,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":5,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1173,"username":"Nightlight","time":1488139169,"value":1},{"userI