</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":62602,"threadID":4221,"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","subject":"","time":1488151241,"lastEditTime":1488151586,"editCount":1,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":2335,"editor":"Thorin Pikachu","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>As my good friend and my assistant <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2229-what/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@WHAT</a> said, Dream servers are becoming gamble <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span> I don&#x27;t mean it in wrong way, cause it is not real money, but it is <span class=\"missing-media\">[funny]</span> how it came out of nowhere <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":62610,"threadID":4221,"userID":2052,"username":"YellowWonderchild","subject":"","time":1488166648,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":-1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2386,"username":"Mr.Pro","time":1488228734,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Nachtfrische</strong></cite><p>!blockrps<br></p></blockquote><p><br>buggt!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Bekomme trotzdem anfragen.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":62613,"threadID":4221,"userID":2526,"username":"Burn","subject":"","time":1488167462,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>YellowWonderchild</strong></cite><p>buggt!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Bekomme trotzdem anfragen.<br></p></blockquote><p>Dann kann es daran liegen das du zwischen durch von dir aus Anfragen versendest oder wenn die Map changed wird der &quot;!blockrps command&quot; entfernt und man muss ihn neu eingeben</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":62618,"threadID":4221,"userID":2165,"username":"O.E.","subject":"","time":1488189346,"lastEditTime":1488189924,"editCount":1,"editReason":"","att